{"title":"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2015 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest\"> UNM-PNM Contest</a></b> problems and solutions. The test was held on February 7, 2015. The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Pro